    <item>
      <title>矩阵乘法优化：从三层循环到 Apple Silicon</title>
      <link>https://lyapple2008.github.io/posts/202609/2026-09-06-%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%E4%B9%98%E6%B3%95%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 21:30:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://lyapple2008.github.io/posts/202609/2026-09-06-%E7%9F%A9%E9%98%B5%E4%B9%98%E6%B3%95%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96/</guid>
      <description>在 Mac mini M2 Pro 上把朴素 GEMM 从 2.5 GFLOPS 推到 Accelerate 的 2.7 TFLOPS。每一步先看数据怎么走，再改代码，最后对照这颗芯片的存储层次和 AMX。</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>深度学习里最贵的那几下，多半是矩阵乘法。注意力的 $QK^{\top}$ 和 $PV$、全连接、卷积展开之后，都是</p>
<p>$$C = AB,\qquad C_{ij}=\sum_k A_{ik},B_{kj}$$</p>
<p>算力是 $O(n^3)$，访存是 $O(n^2)$。算术强度大约是 $n/6$（三个矩阵各扫一遍、FP32）。$n$ 小的时候吃带宽，$n$ 大的时候吃算力。优化不是把循环写得更花，而是让每个被请上芯片的数，多干几次活。</p>
<p>这篇文章按「图示原理 → 硬件瓶颈 → 最短代码 → 本机数字」往下走。平台是眼前这台 <strong>Mac mini M2 Pro</strong>（6 个性能核 + 4 个能效核，16GB 统一内存）。编译器 Apple clang 21，<code>-O3 -ffast-math</code>，方阵 FP32，暖机后取中位数。iOS 和 macOS 共用同一套 Accelerate，后面会单独讲两堵不同的墙。</p>
<p><img alt="一行乘一列，得到 C 的一个数" loading="lazy" src="/images/2026-09/gemm-overview.svg"></p>
<h2 id="先看这颗芯片">先看这颗芯片</h2>
<p>后面每一步都回扣这里。M2 Pro 上其实有两张地图：数据住在哪一层，以及谁来算。</p>
<p><img alt="M2 Pro 存储层次与计算单元" loading="lazy" src="/images/2026-09/gemm-m2pro-hierarchy.svg"></p>
<p>几个后面会反复用到的数：</p>
<ul>
<li>cache line <strong>128B</strong>，一行刚好 32 个 FP32</li>
<li>P 核 L1D 大约 <strong>128KB</strong>，E 核大约 <strong>64KB</strong></li>
<li>性能簇 L2 大约 <strong>16MB</strong>，能效簇大约 <strong>4MB</strong>，SLC 大约 <strong>16MB</strong></li>
<li>统一内存带宽大约 <strong>200 GB/s</strong></li>
<li>计算从下到上：标量 → NEON 128-bit → <strong>AMX</strong> → GPU / ANE</li>
</ul>
<p>macOS 和 iOS 的指令集是同源的。差的不是「会不会写 kernel」，是频率墙、热和 QoS。</p>
<p>用 Roofline 把终点立住：naive 贴在带宽墙上，Accelerate 已经顶到 AMX 的算力墙。中间那些优化，就是把点往右上挪。</p>
<p><img alt="本机 Roofline：naive 贴带宽墙，Accelerate 顶 AMX" loading="lazy" src="/images/2026-09/gemm-roofline.svg"></p>
<p>阶梯是这样的：</p>

<div class="mermaid">flowchart LR
    naive[naive ijk] --&gt; ikj[循环交换 ikj]
    ikj --&gt; tile[Cache 分块]
    tile --&gt; pack[Packing]
    pack --&gt; reg[寄存器分块]
    reg --&gt; neon[NEON 微核]
    neon --&gt; gcd[GCD 多线程]
    gcd --&gt; amx[Accelerate / AMX]</div>
<p>不是每一步都会更快。有的步是在给下一步铺路，单独拿出来测会变慢。这本身就是软硬件合在一起时该有的诚实。</p>
<h2 id="1-naive-ijk按教科书写按列去跳">1. Naive ijk：按教科书写，按列去跳</h2>
<p>图先看。内层循环沿 B 的列往下走：</p>
<p><img alt="naive ijk 的访问轨迹：B 跨行走" loading="lazy" src="/images/2026-09/gemm-naive-ijk.svg"></p>
<p>行主序里，<code>B[k, j]</code> 的下一拍是 <code>B[k+1, j]</code>，中间隔了整行。cache line 请来 32 个数，用完 1 个就丢掉。L1 帮不上忙，预取器也跟不住这种步长。</p>
<p>卡在哪：不是乘法慢，是 <strong>B 的跨步访问把带宽浪费了</strong>。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span><span class="lnt">5
</span><span class="lnt">6
</span><span class="lnt">7
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">j</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">j</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">j</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="kt">float</span> <span class="n">s</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mf">0.f</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">k</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">k</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">k</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="n">s</span> <span class="o">+=</span> <span class="n">A</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">n</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">k</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">B</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">k</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">n</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">j</span><span class="p">];</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="n">C</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">n</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">j</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">s</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div>
<p>本机数字：</p>
<table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th style="text-align: right">N</th>
          <th style="text-align: right">耗时</th>
          <th style="text-align: right">GFLOPS</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: right">64</td>
          <td style="text-align: right">0.072 ms</td>
          <td style="text-align: right">7.28</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
