</table>
<p>$N$ 一大，立刻掉到 2～3 GFLOPS。这就是后面所有加速比的分母。</p>
<h2 id="2-循环交换-ikj同一套乘法换一条路">2. 循环交换 ikj：同一套乘法，换一条路</h2>
<p>把 $j$ 收到最里面。固定一个 $A_{ik}$，沿 B 的第 $k$ 行走过去，C 的第 $i$ 行就地累加。</p>
<p><img alt="ikj：B 和 C 都变成顺序扫" loading="lazy" src="/images/2026-09/gemm-order-ikj.svg"></p>
<p>对照更清楚。上面跨行跳，下面顺序扫，算的是同一件事：</p>
<p><img alt="ijk 与 ikj 访问轨迹对照" loading="lazy" src="/images/2026-09/gemm-order-compare.svg"></p>
<p>卡在哪：还是标量乘法，但 <strong>空间局部性回来了</strong>。128B 的 cache line 里 32 个 FP32 终于被用上。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span><span class="lnt">5
</span><span class="lnt">6
</span><span class="lnt">7
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="nf">memset</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">C</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">n</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="n">n</span> <span class="o">*</span> <span class="k">sizeof</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">float</span><span class="p">));</span>
