<p>只换循环顺序，大矩阵直接快一个数量级。这是整篇文章里，<strong>代码改动最小、收益最稳</strong> 的一步。后面所有花活，都建立在「先别跟 cache line 作对」之上。</p>
<h2 id="3-cache-分块一次只请得起三块">3. Cache 分块：一次只请得起三块</h2>
<p>$N=1024$ 时，三个矩阵各 4MB，已经超出单核 L1，也挤得 L2 很满。ikj 靠预取还能维持 29 GFLOPS，但微核如果想把一块 A 反复乘很多块 B，这三块必须先住进缓存。</p>
<p><img alt="一次只装进能住进 L1/L2 的 A、B、C 三块" loading="lazy" src="/images/2026-09/gemm-tiling.svg"></p>
<p>块大小怎么反推：P 核 L1D 大约 128KB。一块 $128\times 256$ 的 FP32 panel 刚好 128KB，可以钉在 L1；对应的 B panel 放到 L2。A 留下，扫完所有 N 方向的块，再换下一段 K。这就是 Goto / BLIS 那套「外层大块 + 内层微核」的骨架。</p>
<p>卡在哪：工作集超过缓存时，<strong>复用半径必须由块大小显式管住</strong>。预取器救得了顺序流，救不了「同时想记住三块还在长的矩阵」。</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i0</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i0</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i0</span> <span class="o">+=</span> <span class="n">MC</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">k0</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">k0</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">k0</span> <span class="o">+=</span> <span class="n">KC</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">        <span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">j0</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">j0</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">j0</span> <span class="o">+=</span> <span class="n">NC</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">            <span class="cm">/* 对 A[i0:i0+MC, k0:k0+KC] · B[k0:k0+KC, j0:j0+NC] 做 ikj */</span></span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div>
<p>本机上，单独给 ikj 套一层 64×64 分块，并没有更快：</p>
<table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th style="text-align: right">N</th>
          <th style="text-align: right">tiled</th>
          <th style="text-align: right">ikj</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: right">256</td>
          <td style="text-align: right">24.2</td>
          <td style="text-align: right">26.8</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: right">512</td>
          <td style="text-align: right">22.4</td>
          <td style="text-align: right">28.3</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: right">1024</td>
          <td style="text-align: right">20.2</td>
          <td style="text-align: right">28.9</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td style="text-align: right">2048</td>
